    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated just minutes from the vibrant fishing village of Cleggan and nearby Claddaghduff, this unique property combines privacy, natural beauty, and excellent accessibility.\nConveniently located close to local amenities, beaches, and the ferry to Inishbofin.\nThis remarkable holding of land offers an outstanding blend of rugged Connemara beauty and peaceful seclusion. \nFeatures\n• Approximately 4 hectares of coastal land.\n• Extensive shoreline frontage.\n• Private beaches with direct access to the sea.\n• Panoramic sea views across the Atlantic.\n• Magnificent views of the surrounding islands."
      },
